|-------|--------|
| Mystery Guest | ✅ Clean — in-memory SQLite is hermetic, no external I/O |
| Eager Test | ✅ Clean — no test calls 4+ distinct production methods (integration-calibrated) |
| Magic Number Test | ✅ Clean — all numerics are contextually obvious |
| Sensitive Equality | ✅ Clean — no `ToString()` comparisons |
| Exception Handling | ✅ Clean — no try/catch in tests |
| General Fixture | ✅ Clean — both fields used by every test |
| Ignored/Disabled Test | ✅ Clean — no skipped tests |
